% Regression guard for the process_microtones() stack-buffer-overflow.
% A K: key-signature microtone modifier such as "^1/4H" gave note index
% j = 'H' - 'A' = 7, but modmap[]/modmicrotone[] hold only seven entries
% (note letters a-g -> 0..6).  The bound check was "j > 7", which let j == 7
% through and wrote one element past both arrays.  It is now "j > 6", so the
% out-of-range letter is rejected with "Not a valid microtone" and the tune
% still renders.  Built with the sanitize preset against the pre-fix parser
% this input aborts in process_microtones (parseabc.c), so it is a real
% regression guard rather than an output pin.
X:1
T:Microtone index bound
C:abc2midi test
M:4/4
L:1/4
K:C ^1/4H
C D E F |
